        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Black Consciousness Movement</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Where</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/south-africa">South Africa</a>, especially its universities, townships and churches, with strong activity in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/durban">Durban</a> and Soweto; community programmes in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eastern-cape">Eastern Cape</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kwazulu-natal">KwaZulu-Natal</a></span></div>
